# InsightCDR site block — imported into llmdev's existing Caddyfile
# (which already carries the global block and the other sites on :8444/:8445).
#
# Brief-verbatim form was `insightcdr.local:8446`; two deviations, both forced
# by Caddy: (a) a bare-port key (`:8446`) would become the default/catch-all
# TLS automation policy and conflicts with `tls internal` ("key without
# hostname ... in conflict"), and (b) a hostname key would not match the
# release-gate request `curl -sk https://127.0.0.1:8446/login` (Caddy matches
# on Host). The block therefore lists the two addresses it must serve, in the
# same form as the existing pre-existing site blocks. The global block sets
# `auto_https off`; the explicit scheme + `tls internal` force HTTPS here.
https://127.0.0.1:8446, https://192.168.0.123:8446 {
    tls internal
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8011
}
